#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
", and feel\n"
"                    free to"
msgstr "，并可随时"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Annual impact metrics:</b> Review aggregated charts giving your board of\n"
"                directors clear evidence of your social footprint:"
msgstr ""
"<b>年度影响指标：</b>查看汇总图表，为您的董事会提供清晰的社会影响力证据："

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Calendar:</b> Organize medical appointments and family visits with "
"automated\n"
"                reminders for the entire team."
msgstr "<b>日历：</b>安排就医预约和家属探访，并为整个团队自动发送提醒。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Contacts:</b> Securely manage residents, guardians, and medical networks "
"in a\n"
"                centralized, categorized database."
msgstr "<b>联系人：</b>在集中分类的数据库中安全管理住户、监护人和医疗网络。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Daily Liaison Logs:</b> Use Knowledge Articles to record anecdotes and "
"shift\n"
"                handovers. This ensures that the night shift knows exactly "
"what happened during the\n"
"                day."
msgstr ""
"<b>日常交接日志：</b>使用知识文章记录日常见闻和班次交接。这可确保夜班人员准确"
"了解白班发生的事情。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Documents:</b> Store sensitive legal orders, school reports, and care "
"plans in a\n"
"                secure, searchable location."
msgstr ""
"<b>文档：</b>将敏感的法律裁定、学校报告和照护计划存储在安全、可检索的位置。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Employee Records:</b> Store mandatory certifications and training records "
"in the\n"
"                Employees App to ensure compliance with local care "
"regulations."
msgstr ""
"<b>员工档案：</b>在员工应用中保存必需的资质证书和培训记录，确保符合当地照护法"
"规。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Employees:</b> Manage staff certifications and hierarchies to ensure the "
"most\n"
"                qualified team is always on-site."
msgstr "<b>员工：</b>管理员工资质和层级，确保始终有最合适的人员在岗。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Interactive Audit Mode:</b> Access the underlying Spreadsheet behind the\n"
"                    dashboard to switch from \"Automatic\" to \"Manual\" "
"mode. Input any historical\n"
"                    dates to recalculate the entire report instantly. This "
"is perfect for answering\n"
"                    retro-active funding disputes or state audits from 6 "
"months ago."
msgstr ""
"<b>交互式审计模式：</b>进入仪表板背后的电子表格，将模式从“自动”切换为“手动”。"
"输入任意历史日期即可立即重新计算整份报表。这非常适合应对追溯性的资金争议或 6 "
"个月前的国家审计。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Invoicing App:</b> Create and issue receipts or monthly invoices directly "
"to\n"
"                residents based on their actual overnight stays, simplifying "
"front-desk collections\n"
"                and cash management."
msgstr ""
"<b>开票应用：</b>根据住户的实际过夜天数，直接向他们开具收据或月度发票，简化前"
"台收款和现金管理。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Knowledge:</b> Draft collaborative observation logs and formal reports "
"using\n"
"                standardized, professional templates."
msgstr "<b>知识库：</b>使用标准化、专业的模板起草协作观察日志和正式报告。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Leverage Color Tags:</b> Use bright colors for Allergies and Medication\n"
"                        alerts. This visual cue is the fastest way to "
"prevent errors during meal\n"
"                        times or activities."
msgstr ""
"<b>善用颜色标签：</b>用醒目的颜色标记过敏和用药警示。这一视觉提示是防止用餐或"
"活动期间出错的最快方式。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Maintenance</b> – Track repairs for the facility and safety equipment."
msgstr "<b>维护</b>——跟踪设施和安全设备的维修情况。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Meeting Focus:</b> Utilize the Smart Button on the Resident profile to "
"jump\n"
"                directly to meeting notes that focus on that specific "
"individual."
msgstr ""
"<b>会议聚焦：</b>使用住户档案上的智能按钮，直接跳转到针对该特定个人的会议记"
"录。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Mentorship Planning:</b> Document long-term \"Life Paths\" and "
"collaborative goals\n"
"                between mentors and residents, tracking progress through the "
"Project App."
msgstr ""
"<b>导师计划：</b>记录导师与住户之间的长期“人生路径”和共同目标，并通过项目应用"
"跟踪进展。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Monthly overnights:</b> Automatically generate nominative lists of "
"overnight\n"
"                stays for the previous month. The built-in mathematical "
"engine handles ongoing stays\n"
"                (empty departure dates) flawlessly, eliminating manual night-"
"by-night counting."
msgstr ""
"<b>月度过夜统计：</b>自动生成上个月过夜住宿的实名清单。内置计算引擎可完美处理"
"仍在进行的入住（离院日期为空），无需人工逐夜统计。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Nightly Resident Contribution:</b> Utilize a dedicated service product "
"pre-set to\n"
"                your symbolic rate to automate line-item generation and "
"eliminate manual pricing\n"
"                errors."
msgstr ""
"<b>住户夜间费用：</b>使用预先设置为象征性费率的专用服务产品，自动生成明细行并"
"消除手动定价错误。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Planning App:</b> Utilize the Gantt View to visualize 24/7 coverage. "
"Create\n"
"                templates for recurring shifts to save hours on weekly "
"scheduling."
msgstr ""
"<b>排班应用：</b>使用甘特视图直观呈现 24/7 值班安排。为重复班次创建模板，每周"
"排班可节省数小时。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Planning:</b> Coordinate 24/7 staff coverage to ensure safety ratios and\n"
"                consistent caregiver presence."
msgstr "<b>排班：</b>协调 24/7 的员工值班，确保安全配比和照护人员的持续在场。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Project:</b> Track long-term developmental milestones and facility "
"maintenance\n"
"                tasks through organized stages."
msgstr "<b>项目：</b>通过有序的阶段跟踪长期成长里程碑和设施维护任务。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Related data:</b> Leverage the smart buttons from residents to reach "
"their\n"
"                Documents and notes efficiently."
msgstr "<b>相关数据：</b>利用住户上的智能按钮高效访问其文档和备注。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Relationship mapping:</b> Link resident's family unit, precise in charge "
"social\n"
"                workers, general practitioner and more contacts to create a "
"360-degree care circle."
msgstr ""
"<b>关系图谱：</b>关联住户的家庭单元、具体负责的社工、全科医生及更多联系人，构"
"建 360 度照护圈。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Residents App:</b> A specialized workspace to manage the placement "
"lifecycle from\n"
"                admission to successful transition."
msgstr ""
"<b>住户应用：</b>专用于管理从入住到成功转衔的整个安置生命周期的专属工作区。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Residents app:</b> Use the dedicated dashboard to view your current "
"residents."
msgstr "<b>住户应用：</b>使用专用仪表板查看当前住户。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Secure Your Folders:</b> Regularly audit the Documents App folder\n"
"                        permissions to ensure that sensitive legal data is "
"only accessible to\n"
"                        authorized \"Need to Know\" staff."
msgstr ""
"<b>保护您的文件夹：</b>定期审计文档应用的文件夹权限，确保敏感法律数据仅对获得"
"授权的“知悉必要”人员开放。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Shortcuts:</b> Capture shortcut pattern from the Residents App "
"configuration menu\n"
"            and list shortcuts using residents'ids on every portal you "
"frequently go to."
msgstr ""
"<b>快捷方式：</b>从住户应用的配置菜单中获取快捷方式模式，并利用住户 ID 在您经"
"常访问的每个门户上列出快捷方式。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Specialized profiles:</b> Capture unique data like Nicknames, Primary "
"Languages,\n"
"                and Date of Birth to provide personalized, trauma-informed "
"care."
msgstr ""
"<b>专门档案：</b>记录昵称、主要语言和出生日期等独特数据，以提供个性化、创伤知"
"情式的照护。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Standardize Handovers:</b> Encourage all staff to use a specific\n"
"                        Knowledge Template for shift handovers. Consistency "
"in documentation leads\n"
"                        to better continuity of care."
msgstr ""
"<b>规范交接：</b>鼓励所有员工使用特定的知识模板进行班次交接。文档记录的一致性"
"有助于提升照护的连续性。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Standardized Templates:</b> Create \"Report Ready\" articles for School "
"Reports or\n"
"                Life Goal Plans, significantly reducing the time spent on "
"formal correspondence."
msgstr ""
"<b>标准化模板：</b>为学校报告或人生目标计划创建“可直接出具”的文章，大幅减少正"
"式函件所花费的时间。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Subsidy segregation:</b> Route all revenue from resident participations "
"to a\n"
"                distinct income account in your chart of accounts, "
"completely isolating\n"
"                micro-revenues from state subsidies, public grants, and "
"philanthropic funds."
msgstr ""
"<b>补贴分离：</b>将住户参与产生的所有收入计入会计科目表中的独立收入科目，把微"
"额收入与国家补贴、公共拨款和慈善资金彻底隔离。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Tax-exempt configuration:</b> Apply a 0% tax or \"Exempt\" status to "
"your\n"
"                contribution product by default, ensuring full compliance "
"with non-profit legal\n"
"                frameworks without contaminating commercial sales tax "
"workflows."
msgstr ""
"<b>免税配置：</b>默认对您的分摊产品应用 0% 税率或“免税”状态，确保完全符合非营"
"利法律框架，同时不污染商业销售税流程。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Time Off Management:</b> Automatically sync staff absences with the "
"Planning App\n"
"                to identify coverage gaps before they become safety risks."
msgstr ""
"<b>休假管理：</b>自动将员工缺勤与排班应用同步，在覆盖缺口演变为安全风险之前发"
"现它们。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Time Off:</b> Handle leave requests seamlessly without compromising "
"critical\n"
"                caregiver-to-resident safety ratios."
msgstr ""
"<b>休假：</b>无缝处理请假申请，同时不影响关键的照护人员与住户安全配比。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Timesheets:</b> Log specific care hours and administrative tasks for "
"accurate\n"
"                facility operational reporting."
msgstr "<b>工时单：</b>记录具体照护时长和行政事务，以便准确编制设施运营报表。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Timesheets:</b> Staff can log hours against specific care activities, "
"providing\n"
"                management with clear data on administrative vs. direct-care "
"time."
msgstr ""
"<b>工时单：</b>员工可针对具体照护活动记录工时，让管理层清晰了解行政时间与直接"
"照护时间的分布。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Use the Kanban Grouping:</b> Group your Residents App by age or legal\n"
"                        status to get an instant bird's-eye view of your "
"facility's demographic and\n"
"                        legal landscape."
msgstr ""
"<b>使用看板分组：</b>按年龄或法律状态对住户应用进行分组，即可一眼掌握设施的年"
"龄结构和法律状况。"

