#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>\n"
"                    Sign</strong> – Collect digital signatures for placement "
"mandates and approvals."
msgstr ""
"<strong>\n"
"                    电子签名</strong>——收集安置授权书和审批的电子签名。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting</strong> – Advanced financial management and reporting."
msgstr "<strong>会计</strong>——高级财务管理和报表。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>In such situation, feel free to experiment with this database and "
"then\n"
"                        to create a new one for your own usage.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>在这种情况下，您可以随意在此数据库中试用，然后再为自己的使用创建一个"
"新数据库。</strong>"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Purchase</strong> – Manage your suppliers, request for quotations "
"and\n"
"                orders."
