#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Streamline your admission process by moving from the <b>Residents</b> to "
"<b>Documents</b>\n"
"            and <b>Knowledge</b>. This ensures that as soon as a resident is "
"created, their network\n"
"            of guardians is mapped, their legal mandates are filed, and "
"their first appointments are\n"
"            scheduled."
msgstr ""
"通过从 <b>住户</b> 流转到 <b>文档</b> 和 <b>知识库</b>，简化您的入住流程。这"
"可确保住户一经创建，其监护人网络即完成梳理、法律授权书即完成归档，并且首次预"
"约即已安排好。"

