#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With millions of residents in small facilities globally, the need for a "
"secure,\n"
"            integrated system has never been higher. This package leverages "
"Odoo's powerful core\n"
"            modules to transform how small homes manage staff, legal "
"records, and daily care.\n"
"            Ultimately, we are giving care teams the tools to refocus on "
"their true mission: <b>providing\n"
"            a safe, supportive environment for every resident, not just "
"managing clicks.</b>"
msgstr ""
"全球有数百万名住在小型机构中的住户，对安全、集成系统的需求从未如此迫切。此包"
"利用 Odoo 强大的核心模块，改变小型照护机构管理员工、法律记录和日常照护的方"
"式。归根结底，我们是为照护团队提供工具，让他们重新聚焦真正的使命：<b>为每一位"
"住户提供安全、有支持的环境，而不仅仅是管理系统操作。</b>"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr "您想与我们讨论您的 Odoo 配置，或者更进一步吗？"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your\n"
"                    Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"您已完成该演示用例！还有数百万种其他方式可以让您的 Odoo 配置契合您的业务需"
"求。"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
